<title>USA: ESCO Electronics Corp Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>ESCO Electronics Corp Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary profit     $3.47     loss	 $0.45</p>
<p> Shr diluted profit     $3.46     loss	 $0.45</p>
<p> Net profit		41,211     loss	 4,927</p>
<p> Revs			99,386		  125,096</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) NOTE: FY96 Q4 includes $48.5 million gain from sale of former Hazeltine subsidiary. Non-recurring charges in FY95 Q4 resulted from facilities consolidation charges of $5.1 million.  </p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr primary profit     $2.26     loss	$ 2.76</p>
<p> Shr diluted profit     $2.25     loss	 $2.76</p>
<p> Net profit		26,136     loss	30,260</p>
<p> Revs		     438,543		  441,023</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Period ended September 30.</p>
<p>FY95 year results include non-recurring charges of $35.4 million for facilities consolidation programs and write-off of certain pre-paid assets. FY96 includes non-recurring charge of $25.3 million.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
